% Matrix role (HX): X-type stabilizer parity-check matrix H_X = [ L(a) | R(b) ] (shape l x 2l; detects Z errors).
%   Paired with finG=<tag>_HZ.mtx (or finL=<tag>_LX.mtx) in dist_m4ri to compute d_Z.
